cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ScrapLogGit2Net: Inter-Individual and Inter-Organizational Co-Editing Networks from Git Logs"
abstract: >-
  ScrapLogGit2Net is an open-source command-line toolset that builds
  co-editing collaboration networks from a plain git log. Developers are
  nodes, identified by commit e-mail, and are linked when they edited the
  same source file. Organizations are inferred from e-mail domains, so the
  same log yields inter-individual and inter-organizational networks
  (unweighted, weighted, and temporal), exported as GraphML, with scripts
  to filter, report, visualize, and compare them.
authors:
